{"ts": "2026-08-10T11:16:17.330743+07:00", "tool": "codex", "event": "UserPromptSubmit", "session_id": "019fe9e2-9a02-7990-a3e9-55d6c83457b6", "model": "cx/gpt-5.6-terra", "repo": "P-052", "branch": "docs", "commit": "026f589", "student": "", "prompt": "Create a project-scoped Codex custom agent named tech-lead.\n\nIt is the orchestration and planning-gate authority for this project.\n\nUse:\nmodel = \"cx/gpt-5.6-sol\"\nmodel_reasoning_effort = \"high\"\n\nIts responsibilities are:\n- coordinate the BMAD workflow\n- verify planning readiness before implementation\n- route product decisions to the PM\n- route architecture decisions to the Architect\n- require explicit acceptance criteria\n- identify unresolved cross-role conflicts\n- decide which specialist should handle work\n- perform final synthesis for substantial changes\n\nIt must not use Ponytail.\n\nIt should not routinely implement production code.\n\nIt must respect project AGENTS.md and the approved BMAD artifacts as higher authority.\n\nCreate only the Codex agent definition. Do not modify BMAD agent customizations.", "turn_id": "019fe9e2-b6aa-70f1-a345-1ab7879b0f8f", "transcript_path": "/home/node/.codex/sessions/2026/08/10/rollout-2026-08-10T11-16-09-019fe9e2-9a02-7990-a3e9-55d6c83457b6.jsonl"}
