{"ts": "2026-08-10T11:30:14.698041+07:00", "tool": "codex", "event": "UserPromptSubmit", "session_id": "019fe9e2-9a02-7990-a3e9-55d6c83457b6", "model": "cx/gpt-5.6-terra", "repo": "P-052", "branch": "docs", "commit": "026f589", "student": "", "prompt": "Create a project-scoped Codex custom agent named developer.\n\nUse:\nmodel = \"cx/gpt-5.6-luna\"\nmodel_reasoning_effort = \"high\"\n\nThis agent executes the customized bmad-agent-dev role.\n\nIt is a professional software, DevOps, and optimization implementation engineer.\n\nIt must:\n- follow approved BMAD stories and architecture\n- use the existing Developer customization as its behavioral authority\n- invoke the global Ponytail skill when appropriate for approved implementation\n- run applicable tests and verification\n- escalate product or architecture ambiguity instead of inventing decisions\n\nIt must not perform final approval of its own work.\n\nCreate only the Codex execution agent. Do not duplicate the full BMAD Developer prompt.", "turn_id": "019fe9ef-7de5-7601-80fb-f7adbca123dc", "transcript_path": "/home/node/.codex/sessions/2026/08/10/rollout-2026-08-10T11-16-09-019fe9e2-9a02-7990-a3e9-55d6c83457b6.jsonl"}
