{"ts": "2026-08-10T11:35:57.208437+07:00", "tool": "codex", "event": "UserPromptSubmit", "session_id": "019fe9e2-9a02-7990-a3e9-55d6c83457b6", "model": "cx/gpt-5.6-terra", "repo": "P-052", "branch": "docs", "commit": "026f589", "student": "", "prompt": "Create a project-scoped Codex custom agent named frontend-worker.\n\nUse:\nmodel = \"ag/gemini-3.6-flash-high\"\n\nThis is a bounded frontend implementation worker.\n\nIt must implement only from:\n- approved product requirements\n- approved UX specifications\n- approved architecture\n- active story acceptance criteria\n\nIt may not redefine product scope, UX requirements, backend contracts, or architecture.\n\nIt may use Ponytail selectively, but Ponytail must never reduce:\n- accessibility\n- responsive behavior\n- approved visual requirements\n- interaction behavior\n- maintainable component reuse\n\nIt must run applicable frontend tests, type checks, lint, and builds before reporting completion.\n\nCreate only the Codex execution agent.", "turn_id": "019fe9f4-b7e3-79c0-8e93-13a3750668d3", "transcript_path": "/home/node/.codex/sessions/2026/08/10/rollout-2026-08-10T11-16-09-019fe9e2-9a02-7990-a3e9-55d6c83457b6.jsonl"}
